Source: omakasui-zellij
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Luca Pattocchio <info@lucapattocchio.dev>
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/omakasui/omakasui-zellij

Package: omakasui-zellij
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zellij, gum
Description: Zellij configuration (shared payload)
 Installs the omakub-based zellij configuration to /usr/share/omakasui-zellij,
 plus the shared setup script. Install omakub-zellij or omadeb-zellij to get
 the project-specific setup command.

Package: omakub-zellij
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, omakasui-zellij (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Zellij configuration for Omabuntu/Omakub
 Provides the omakub-setup-zellij command, which activates the shared
 omakasui-zellij configuration for the current user.

Package: omadeb-zellij
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, omakasui-zellij (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Zellij configuration for Omadeb
 Provides the omadeb-setup-zellij command, which activates the shared
 omakasui-zellij configuration for the current user.
